Local PDF extraction uses Poppler command-line utilities (GPL-2.0-or-later), installed through the Alpine package repository.
Upstream: https://poppler.freedesktop.org/
Local OCR uses Tesseract and English, Thai and orientation language data (Apache-2.0), installed through the Alpine package repository.
Upstream: https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract
Language models: https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdata_fast
These are separate local executables; EDP does not send document content to an external OCR service.
